(1201, '熬夜工作或学习', 'burn the midnight oil', '习语', '工作', 3, 'I had to burn the midnight oil to finish the report.', '为了完成报告，我不得不熬夜。', 'verb phrase', true, false, '/bɜrn ðə ˈmɪdˌnaɪt ɔɪl/'),
