(1206, '迟做总比不做好', 'better late than never', '习语', '时间', 3, 'You finally replied; better late than never.', '你终于回复了，迟回总比不回好。', 'proverb', true, false, '/ˈbɛtər leɪt ðæn ˈnɛvər/'),
