(1209, '很快', 'in no time', '习语', '时间', 2, 'You will feel better in no time.', '你很快就会好起来。', 'adverb phrase', true, false, '/ɪn noʊ taɪm/'),
(1210, '到目前为止一切顺利', 'so far so good', '习语', '进展', 2, 'We have started the project; so far so good.', '我们已经开始这个项目，目前一切顺利。', 'clause', true, false, '/soʊ fɑr soʊ ɡʊd/'),
(1211, '出乎意料地；突然', 'out of the blue', '习语', '意外', 3, 'She called me out of the blue.', '她突然给我打了电话。', 'adverb phrase', true, false, '/aʊt əv ðə blu/'),
(1212, '因祸得福的事', 'a blessing in disguise', '习语', '得失', 3, 'Missing that train was a blessing in disguise.', '错过那班火车反而成了一件好事。', 'noun phrase', true, false, '/ə ˈblɛsɪŋ ɪn dɪsˈɡaɪz/'),
(1213, '黑暗中总有一线光明', 'every cloud has a silver lining', '习语', '希望', 4, 'Remember, every cloud has a silver lining.', '记住，困境中总有一线希望。', 'proverb', true, false, '/ˈɛvri klaʊd hæz ə ˈsɪlvər ˈlaɪnɪŋ/'),
(1214, '两全其美', 'the best of both worlds', '习语', '选择', 3, 'Working near home gives me the best of both worlds.', '在家附近工作让我两全其美。', 'noun phrase', true, false, '/ðə bɛst əv boʊθ wɜrldz/'),
(1215, '双赢局面', 'a win-win situation', '习语', '合作', 2, 'Sharing the office is a win-win situation.', '共用办公室是个双赢的安排。', 'noun phrase', true, false, '/ə ˌwɪn ˈwɪn ˌsɪtʃuˈeɪʃən/'),
(1216, '一举两得', 'kill two birds with one stone', '习语', '效率', 3, 'Walking to work lets me kill two birds with one stone: travel and exercise.', '步行上班让我一举两得：既通勤又锻炼。', 'verb phrase', true, false, '/kɪl tu bɜrdz wɪð wʌn stoʊn/'),
(1217, '孤注一掷', 'put all your eggs in one basket', '习语', '风险', 3, 'Do not put all your eggs in one basket.', '别把所有希望都押在一件事上。', 'verb phrase', true, false, '/pʊt ɔl jʊr ɛɡz ɪn wʌn ˈbæskət/'),
(1218, '谨慎行事', 'play it safe', '习语', '风险', 2, 'Let us play it safe and leave early.', '我们稳妥一点，早点出发吧。', 'verb phrase', true, false, '/pleɪ ɪt seɪf/'),
(1219, '改天再约', 'take a rain check', '习语', '社交', 3, 'Can I take a rain check on dinner?', '晚饭能改天再约吗？', 'verb phrase', true, false, '/teɪk ə reɪn tʃɛk/'),
(1220, '持观望态度；不表态', 'sit on the fence', '习语', '决定', 3, 'You cannot sit on the fence forever.', '你不能一直不表态。', 'verb phrase', true, false, '/sɪt ɑn ðə fɛns/'),
(1221, '犹豫不决', 'on the fence', '习语', '决定', 3, 'I am still on the fence about moving.', '对于搬家，我还在犹豫。', 'adjective phrase', true, false, '/ɑn ðə fɛns/'),
(1222, '尚未确定', 'up in the air', '习语', '决定', 2, 'Our travel plans are still up in the air.', '我们的旅行计划还没定下来。', 'adjective phrase', true, false, '/ʌp ɪn ði ɛr/'),
(1223, '简而言之', 'in a nutshell', '习语', '沟通', 3, 'In a nutshell, we need more time.', '简而言之，我们需要更多时间。', 'adverb phrase', true, false, '/ɪn ə ˈnʌtˌʃɛl/'),
(1224, '长话短说', 'to make a long story short', '习语', '沟通', 3, 'To make a long story short, we missed the bus.', '长话短说，我们错过了公交车。', 'discourse phrase', true, false, '/tə meɪk ə lɔŋ ˈstɔri ʃɔrt/'),
(1225, '拐弯抹角', 'beat around the bush', '习语', '沟通', 3, 'Do not beat around the bush; tell me what happened.', '别拐弯抹角，告诉我发生了什么。', 'verb phrase', true, false, '/bit əˈraʊnd ðə bʊʃ/'),
(1226, '直奔主题', 'get straight to the point', '习语', '沟通', 2, 'Let me get straight to the point.', '让我直奔主题吧。', 'verb phrase', true, false, '/ɡɛt streɪt tə ðə pɔɪnt/'),
(1227, '领会言外之意', 'read between the lines', '习语', '沟通', 3, 'Read between the lines of her message.', '体会一下她消息里的言外之意。', 'verb phrase', true, false, '/rid bɪˈtwin ðə laɪnz/'),
